{"text":"It's all that oxytocin in the system. This is why shaking hands matters. Imagine you're doing a deal with someone, and you're ready to sign the contract, and you say, I'm so excited to do business with you. And they go, I don't need to shake, let's sign the contract, I'm also excited to do business with you. You go, great, well let's shake on it then. They go, no, no, no, no, I agree to all the terms, let's get this deal done, I can't wait to work with you. You might get everything you want in the contract, but business, relationships are not rational. They're about feeling safe, they're about feeling we belong, it's human. And one of the ways we wanna know that that relationship is solidified is with physical touch. Their simple refusal to touch you, to exchange that oxytocin, means one of two things will happen. You will either completely scuttle the deal, or you will go into it nervous.","words":[{"text":"It's","start":0.38,"end":0.7},{"text":"all","start":0.7,"end":0.76},{"text":"that","start":0.76,"end":0.9},{"text":"oxytocin","start":0.9,"end":1.4},{"text":"in","start":1.4,"end":1.5},{"text":"the","start":1.5,"end":1.58},{"text":"system","start":1.58,"end":1.86,"punct":"."},{"text":"This","start":3.08,"end":3.2},{"text":"is","start":3.2,"end":3.34},{"text":"why","start":3.34,"end":3.54},{"text":"shaking","start":3.54,"end":3.88},{"text":"hands","start":3.88,"end":4.42},{"text":"matters","start":4.42,"end":4.78,"punct":"."},{"text":"Imagine","start":5.44,"end":5.66},{"text":"you're","start":5.66,"end":5.96},{"text":"doing","start":5.96,"end":6.12},{"text":"a","start":6.12,"end":6.26},{"text":"deal","start":6.26,"end":6.42},{"text":"with","start":6.42,"end":6.58},{"text":"someone","start":6.58,"end":6.92,"punct":","},{"text":"and","start":7.68,"end":8.0},{"text":"you're","start":8.0,"end":8.32},{"text":"ready","start":8.32,"end":8.46},{"text":"to","start":8.46,"end":8.62},{"text":"sign","start":8.62,"end":8.76},{"text":"the","start":8.76,"end":8.92},{"t